emple or church, middle-ranking members of the army, merchants, and perhaps some of the more skilled craftsmen. Amongst such a class there would probably be some foreigners, permitted to live in Ethiopia because of their special skills."'}], {'usage.total_tokens': 2257, 'temperature': 0.2})
